msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Get-Started/Installation/RMW-Implementations/DDS-Implementations/Working-with-eProsima-Fast-DDS.rst:16
msgid ""
"eProsima Fast DDS is a complete open-source Data Distribution Service (DDS) "
"implementation for real-time embedded architectures and operating systems. "
"This article describes how to install ``rmw_fastrtps_cpp``, select it as "
"your active RMW implementation, and verify that it is working. After you "
"follow these steps, you can run ROS nodes using eProsima Fast DDS."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Get-Started/Installation/RMW-Implementations/DDS-Implementations/Working-with-eProsima-Fast-DDS.rst:20
msgid ""
"eProsima Fast DDS is a complete open-source DDS implementation for real time "
"embedded architectures and operating systems. See also: https://www.eprosima."
"com/index.php/products-all/eprosima-fast-dds"
msgstr ""

